y = Σ_{k=1}^6 k cos^{-1}{(3/5 cos kx - 4/5 sin kx)}

Let cos α = 3/5 and sin α = 4/5

∴ y = Σ_{k=1}^6 k cos^{-1}{(cos α cos kx - sin α sin kx)}
= Σ_{k=1}^6 k cos^{-1}{(cos(kx + α))}
= Σ_{k=1}^6 k(kx + α) = Σ_{k=1}^6 (k^2 x + αk)

dy/dx = Σ_{k=1}^6 k^2 = 6(7)(13)/6 = 91

